    Note that outer and inner locators must belong to the same frame. Inner locator must not contain [`FrameLocator`](`PlaywrightEx.FrameLocator`)s.
  * `:has_not_text` (`t:String.t/0` | `t:Regex.t/0` | `t:PlaywrightEx.RegExp.t/0`) - *Since Playwright 1.33.* Matches elements that do not contain specified text somewhere inside, possibly in a child or a descendant element. When passed a `string`, matching is case-insensitive and searches for a substring.
